{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07473","headline":"送常十九归嵩少故林 · 刘长卿","name":"送常十九归嵩少故林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢迢此恨杳无涯，楚泽嵩丘千里赊。\n岐路别时惊一叶，云林归处忆三花。\n秋天苍翠寒飞鴈，古堞萧条晚噪鵶。\n他日山中逢胜事，桃源洞里几人家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07473.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07473","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}